{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Step to the beat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/8d1b6e91391b18b58bff3a3d38d64e58.poster.avif?t=1762027501\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/8d1b6e91391b18b58bff3a3d38d64e58.webm?t=1762027501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/8d1b6e91391b18b58bff3a3d38d64e58.mp4?t=1762027501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asterika is a grid-based rhythm game about movement and flow. Move with the music, weave through obstacles, and adapt to shifting tempos and patterns!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Carve your path</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no fixed button patterns you need to press. Instead, feel the beat, observe the incoming dangers, and find your own way forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Follow the story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/51f674873e9066bf1fb3a9afbc364d2c.poster.avif?t=1762027501\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/51f674873e9066bf1fb3a9afbc364d2c.webm?t=1762027501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/51f674873e9066bf1fb3a9afbc364d2c.mp4?t=1762027501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into optional narrative of Asterika as the &quot;Engineer&quot;, caught in the pursuit between two girls and their conflict tied to a magic-fueled city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Build your own challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a curated selection of piano and electronic tracks from talented artists with varying difficulties. But go further and use the built-in beatmap editor to create your custom stages and share!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690850?t=1762027501","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690850?t=1762027501","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/3a99f87270a606d65180a30b486d68264d86ae79/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762027501","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/3a99f87270a606d65180a30b486d68264d86ae79/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762027501","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4112250,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Step to the beat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/8d1b6e91391b18b58bff3a3d38d64e58.poster.avif?t=1762027501\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/8d1b6e91391b18b58bff3a3d38d64e58.webm?t=1762027501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/8d1b6e91391b18b58bff3a3d38d64e58.mp4?t=1762027501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asterika is a gri